| Path | Responsibility |
|---|---|
| `src/metag/cli.py`, `src/metag/tools/` | Scoring entry point and maintained diagnostics |
| `src/metag/routing/` | Balanced structures, stereo, references and state declarations |
| `src/metag/energetics/` | Molecular energies, sampling, minimum validation and state thermodynamics |
| `src/metag/state_pools.py`, `assembly.py` | Complete pools, reaction assembly and shared sampling bookkeeping |
